You need a magic whistle.  I find these pets very useful then, because 
they can block attacks from summoned monsters; also later in the game 
you will get stronger pets.  As a lawful, I once got three planetars 
which killed most demon lords for me (not Demogorgon, alas).  Moreover, 
on the astral plane, the riders never got close to me, because my pets 
killed them. Finally, they seem to come for free: you will not have to 
refrain from praying afterwards.  So they are minor gifts in comparison 
with artifacts, although my planetars were much more useful than any 
artifact; they saved my life in Moloch's temple.

It may however be that only lawfuls get really strong pets, because I 
don't see what neutrals can get beyond elementals and chaotics beyond 
demons.

If you don't care about keeping them either because you can't or you 
don't want to, just leave them.  I don't believe they will become 
hostile, they only lose their tameness.

> Is there some trick to getting artifacts as rewards?  

Just sacrifice long enough...  I don't think that there is a trick of 
avoiding the minions, though.
